As she's walking up the stairs, she's actually only walking on her toes because I

1174
00:52:33.220 --> 00:52:36.760
think the stairs had little slats and I think her heel would have gotten stuck.

1175
00:52:37.060 --> 00:52:38.120
Oh, there it is.

1176
00:52:38.360 --> 00:52:39.280
I think you're right.

1177
00:52:39.400 --> 00:52:40.320
It was a safety issue.

1178
